{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">國家主席習近平夫人彭麗媛在開羅訪問期間，與埃及總統塞西夫人依緹薩爾茶敘。彭麗媛與依緹薩爾就中埃友好、人文交往等親切交流。兩人亦參觀小型手工藝品展。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EGY.PENG-1500_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Pjod7B2a571788416336.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.EGY.PENG-1500_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">彭麗媛表示，埃及歷史悠久、文化底蘊深厚，展品十分精美，充分體現埃及人民的聰明才智和獨特審美；中埃兩國文化有很多共通之處，希望兩國藝術家加強交流合作，讓傳統手工藝在傳承和互鑒中，不斷煥發新的光彩。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.EGY.PENG-1500_004.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026ruh3uLY94K1788416324.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.EGY.PENG-1500_004.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T07:04:04.835527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}